.IX Title "PACINI 1"
.TH PACINI 1 2025-12-04 pacutils pacini
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
.\" way too many mistakes in technical documents.
.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH "نام (NAME)"
pacini \- query pacman\-style configuration files
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
.Vb 2
\& pacini [options] [<file> [<directive>...]]
\& pacini (\-\-section\-list|\-\-help|\-\-version)
.Ve
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
Query configuration options from pacman\-style INI files.  If no \fIdirective\fRs
are provided, \fIfile\fR will be printed in a normalized format.  By default, if
only a single \fIdirective\fR is provided, only its value will be printed without
the option name.  For directives without a value, the directive name will be
used as the value.  If \fIfile\fR is omitted or \f(CW\*(C`\-\*(C'\fR the configuration will be
read from \fIstdin\fR.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.IX Header "OPTIONS"
.IP \fB\-\-section\fR=\fIname\fR 4
.IX Item "--section=name"
Only display directives listed in section \fIname\fR.
.IP \fB\-\-section\-list\fR 4
.IX Item "--section-list"
List configured sections.
.IP \fB\-\-verbose\fR 4
.IX Item "--verbose"
Always show directive names even if only one \fIdirective\fR is provided.
.IP \fB\-\-help\fR 4
.IX Item "--help"
Display usage information and exit.
.IP \fB\-\-version\fR 4
.IX Item "--version"
Display version information and exit.
